233
00:15:30,834 --> 00:15:31,750
Tidak bisa.

234
00:15:31,751 --> 00:15:32,750
Aku percaya bisa.

235
00:15:32,751 --> 00:15:33,667
Meski bisa…

236
00:15:33,668 --> 00:15:35,708
