240
00:15:41,459 --> 00:15:43,125
Akan ada perang penawaran.

241
00:15:43,126 --> 00:15:46,083
Di mana jutaan menjadi miliaran.

242
00:15:46,084 --> 00:15:48,458
Agar tercapai,
