01:01:09,168 --> 01:01:10,793
Lanjutkan. Kau tak terlihat.

999
01:01:20,293 --> 01:01:21,584
TIDAK ADA SINYAL

1000
01:01:24,209 --> 01:01:25,375
Kacau sekali.

1001
01:01:25,376 --> 01:01:27,292
Visual terputus di tangga D3.

1002
01:01:27,293 --> 01:01:29,584
- Kebocoran di mana-mana.
- Tentu saja.

1003
01:01:30,751 --> 01:01:31,958
Benjy, kau dengar?

1004
01:01:31,959 --> 01:01:33,500
- Ya.
- Di mana kau?

1005
01:01:33,501 --> 01:01:35,042
Hampir sampai.

1006
01:01:35,043 --> 01:01:37,459
Kita seperti tamu naratama malam ini.

1007
01:01:45,251 --> 01:01:46,708
Siap di posisi.

1008
01:01:46,709 --> 01:01:47,625
Pimpinlah.

1009
01:01:47,626 --> 01:01:48,542
Baik.

1010
01:01:48,543 --> 01:01:49,918
Meluncur.

1011
01:02:10,418 --> 01:02:12,626
Hampir sampai. Bersiaplah.

1012
01:02:13,293 --> 01:02:14,750
Yakin tak ada cadangan?

1013
01:02:14,751 --> 01:02:15,833
Mau taruhan?

1014
01:02:15,834 --> 01:02:17,250
Poker telanjang?

1015
01:02:17,251 --> 01:02:18,626
Ya atau tidak?

1016
01:02:19,418 --> 01:02:20,543
Mematikan listrik.

1017
01:02:21,459 --> 01:02:23,584
Tiga, dua, satu.

1018
01:02:40,251 --> 01:02:41,293
Jalan.

1019
01:03:12,543 --> 01:03:13,793
Apa itu tadi?

1020
01:03:15,293 --> 01:03:16,583
Ada apa ini?

1021
01:03:16,584 --> 01:03:19,418
Ternyata bukan cuma kita yang mogok kerja.

1022
01:03:39,668 --> 01:03:41,250
Siapa pria itu?

1023
01:03:41,251 --> 01:03:43,084
Dia tim pemeliharaan, 'kan?

1024
01:03:43,626 --> 01:03:44,709
Apa yang dia bawa?

1025
01:03:48,334 --> 01:03:50,084
Perlukah kita periksa?

1026
01:03:56,418 --> 01:03:59,709
Sabayon telur burung unta
dengan parutan truffle hitam.

1027
01:04:16,876 --> 01:04:17,834
Hei!

1028
01:04:22,876 --> 01:04:25,125
Perlihatkan apa yang kau bawa keluar.

1029
01:04:25,126 --> 01:04:26,084
Ini?

1030
01:04:26,793 --> 01:04:27,833
Ya.

1031
01:04:27,834 --> 01:04:28,709
Tentu saja.

1032
01:04:32,459 --> 01:04:33,876
Aku kuliah sebelum kerja.

1033
01:04:37,293 --> 01:04:38,209
Menurutmu?

1034
01:04:43,168 --> 01:04:44,168
Jujur saja.

1035
01:04:46,251 --> 01:04:47,418
Kau boleh pergi.

1036
01:04:47,834 --> 01:04:48,793
Aman.

1037
01:04:49,251 --> 01:04:50,209
Terima kasih.

1038
01:05:20,209 --> 01:05:21,043
Jalan.

1039
01:05:24,834 --> 01:05:25,793
Ada apa ini?

1040
01:05:26,209 --> 01:05:28,084
Tenang. Sebentar lagi menyala.

1041
01:07:17,793 --> 01:07:20,375
Daging rusa panggang flambe,
truffle seledri,

1042
01:07:20,376 --> 01:07:21,918
dan saus Périgourdine.

1043
01:07:51,543 --> 01:07:55,751
Goyang-goyang.

1044
01:08:10,543 --> 01:08:11,668
Mo?

1045
01:08:12,459 --> 01:08:13,500
Bicaralah.

1046
01:08:13,501 --> 01:08:16,042
Kutemukan alat aneh. Bukan milik kita.

1047
01:08:16,043 --> 01:08:16,959
Apa?

1048
01:08:24,709 --> 01:08:28,042
Entahlah. Sepertinya kita diretas.

1049
01:08:28,043 --> 01:08:30,209
Mona Lisa ada di sini.
Tak apa-apa.

1050
01:08:31,543 --> 01:08:32,376
Ya?

1051
01:08:32,876 --> 01:08:34,375
Benamar. Semua aman?

1052
01:08:34,376 --> 01:08:38,126
Kami harus pindahkan Mona Lisa.
Ada yang aneh dengan sensornya.

1053
01:08:38,793 --> 01:08:40,709
Namun, adakah yang tak beres?

1054
01:08:41,626 --> 01:08:43,750
Aku tak yakin. Kenapa?

1055
01:08:43,751 --> 01:08:45,918
Kurasa kunci aksesku dicuri.

1056
01:09:00,168 --> 01:09:02,458
Sial. Semua unit, tutup akses.

1057
01:09:02,459 --> 01:09:03,543
Tutup akses sekarang.

1058
01:09:35,376 --> 01:09:36,793
Lari, demi Tuhan!

1059
01:10:38,084 --> 01:10:39,333
Bagaimana anginnya?

1060
01:10:39,334 --> 01:10:40,626
Stabil dari barat.

1061
01:10:41,959 --> 01:10:43,543
Tak ada yang terlewat, 'kan?

1062
01:10:44,334 --> 01:10:45,250
Tidak.

1063
01:10:45,251 --> 01:10:46,709
Kurasa tidak. Kau benar.

1064
01:10:48,376 --> 01:10:49,793
Tak ada yang terlewat…

1065
01:10:53,084 --> 01:10:54,375
Sial.

1066
01:10:54,376 --> 01:10:56,293
Sialan.

1067
01:11:33,084 --> 01:11:34,251
Dia di atas kita.

1068
01:11:35,626 --> 01:11:36,626
Kemarilah, Sayang.

1069
01:11:40,334 --> 01:11:42,126
- Di sana.
- Ya.

1070
01:12:42,709 --> 01:12:44,708
Aku tahu kau pasti bisa!

1071
01:12:44,709 --> 01:12:46,875
Aku tahu! Kemarilah!

1072
01:12:46,876 --> 01:12:48,083
Aku tahu!

1073
01:12:48,084 --> 01:12:49,793
Aku tahu kalian pasti bisa!

1074
01:12:50,293 --> 01:12:51,126
Tunjukkan.

1075
01:12:59,959 --> 01:13:01,084
Ya Tuhan.

1076
01:13:07,543 --> 01:13:08,708
Polisi?

1077
01:13:08,709 --> 01:13:10,292
Kehilangan arah di Paris.

1078
01:13:10,293 --> 01:13:11,417
Raib tanpa jejak.

1079
01:13:11,418 --> 01:13:14,375
Tapi kendaraanmu tetap bisa dilacak.

1080
01:13:14,376 --> 01:13:15,542
Tetap tukar mobil.

1081
01:13:15,543 --> 01:13:16,833
- Terlalu bahaya.
- Tidak.

1082
01:13:16,834 --> 01:13:18,208
- Kau bisa dibui.
- Tidak.

1083
01:13:18,209 --> 01:13:19,459
Aku tak mau dengar.

1084
01:13:20,251 --> 01:13:21,583
Ini mahakaryamu.

1085
01:13:21,584 --> 01:13:23,251
Bawa ini pakai Jaguar.

1086
01:13:24,001 --> 01:13:26,042
Temui aku di rumah aman.

1087
01:13:26,043 --> 01:13:28,208
Jika aku tak datang dalam 48 jam,

1088
01:13:28,209 --> 01:13:30,001
sembunyikanlah dengan aman.

1089
01:13:30,459 --> 01:13:31,293
Lalu…

1090
01:13:32,001 --> 01:13:33,458
pergilah ke Zurich.

1091
01:13:33,459 --> 01:13:34,334
Seperti ini.

1092
01:13:39,334 --> 01:13:41,751
Mengerti? Hiduplah dari ini.

1093
01:13:42,334 --> 01:13:43,334
Lalu bersembunyi.

1094
01:13:43,834 --> 01:13:45,292
Jangan coba mencariku.

1095
01:13:45,293 --> 01:13:46,250
Aku cari kalian.

1096
01:13:46,251 --> 01:13:47,667
Kenapa tidak pergi bersama?

1097
01:13:47,668 --> 01:13:48,792
Ya, ikut kami.

1098
01:13:48,793 --> 01:13:51,792
Tidak, para anjing itu
butuh umpan untuk dikejar.

1099
01:13:51,793 --> 01:13:53,583
Aku tak mau kehilanganmu.

1100
01:13:53,584 --> 01:13:54,750
Aku tahu.

1101
01:13:54,751 --> 01:13:57,167
Kita akan segera bertemu. Janji.

1102
01:13:57,168 --> 01:13:59,042
Kita baru saling mengenal.

1103
01:13:59,043 --> 01:14:00,126
Pergilah sekarang.

1104
01:14:01,084 --> 01:14:02,084
Pergilah. Cepat!

1105
01:14:58,626 --> 01:14:59,626
Kurasa sudah aman.

1106
01:15:00,334 --> 01:15:01,668
Ayo kita masukkan.

1107
01:15:17,209 --> 01:15:18,459
Kita tak meninggalkan mobil.

1108
01:15:21,126 --> 01:15:22,584
Saat aku ke toilet.

1109
01:15:23,543 --> 01:15:24,458
Aku di mobil.

1110
01:15:24,459 --> 01:15:26,543
Bagasi tak tersentuh. Mustahil.

1111
01:15:28,626 --> 01:15:29,876
Bagasi modifikasi?

1112
01:15:30,418 --> 01:15:32,001
Mungkin Ayah tahu.

1113
01:15:33,793 --> 01:15:35,001
Dia pasti bilang.

1114
01:15:57,043 --> 01:15:58,126
Ini mesin…

1115
01:15:59,043 --> 01:16:01,418
pencuri lukisan bermotor.

1116
01:16:03,626 --> 01:16:04,459
Ya.

1117
01:16:04,918 --> 01:16:06,875
Kita memang melewatkan sesuatu.

1118
01:16:06,876 --> 01:16:07,959
Perampokan keluarga.

1119
01:16:09,459 --> 01:16:11,126
Tak masalah jika kau Borgia.

1120
01:16:16,834 --> 01:16:18,584
- Kecuali ibumu…
- Tidak.

1121
01:16:19,876 --> 01:16:21,792
Tes DNA bisa dipalsukan,

1122
01:16:21,793 --> 01:16:23,542
tapi ibuku membenarkannya.

1123
01:16:23,543 --> 01:16:25,333
- Apa dia…
- Jangan katakan.

1124
01:16:25,334 --> 01:16:26,833
- Jay, pikir.
- Tak perlu.

1125
01:16:26,834 --> 01:16:28,958
- Kau percaya?
- Tentu. Dia ibuku.

1126
01:16:28,959 --> 01:16:30,208
Mana ada ibu begitu.

1127
01:16:30,209 --> 01:16:31,417
Kau tahu dari mana?

1128
01:16:31,418 --> 01:16:32,750
Aku tak paham soal ibu,

1129
01:16:32,751 --> 01:16:34,042
tapi aku tahu penipuan.

1130
01:16:34,043 --> 01:16:35,625
Kenapa tak bilang dari awal?

1131
01:16:35,626 --> 01:16:37,208
Kau yakinkan aku, Anak Mami.

1132
01:16:37,209 --> 01:16:38,458
Kau iri. Aku paham.

1133
01:16:38,459 --> 01:16:39,458
Ya. Iri kenapa?

1134
01:16:39,459 --> 01:16:41,833
Aku punya ibu dan ayah. Itu fakta.

1135
01:16:41,834 --> 01:16:43,208
Namun, kau siapa?

1136
01:16:43,209 --> 01:16:44,418
Karyawan?

1137
01:16:45,334 --> 01:16:47,583
Dasar sok hebat.

1138
01:16:47,584 --> 01:16:49,875
- Kau bajingan.
- Aku tahu kata itu.

1139
01:16:49,876 --> 01:16:52,250
- "Ibu, Ayah, lihat aku!"
- Kau tahu?

1140
01:16:52,251 --> 01:16:54,208
- Kau jalang.
- Kau tak penting!

1141
01:16:54,209 --> 01:16:55,583
Jago di kibor saja.

1142
01:16:55,584 --> 01:16:57,708
Saat harus bertindak, kau mangkir.

1143
01:16:57,709 --> 01:17:00,667
Perampokan itu, Mona Lisa,
aku yang melakukan.

1144
01:17:00,668 --> 01:17:03,501
Ya, kau yang melakukan, lalu kenapa?

1145
01:17:04,001 --> 01:17:04,918
Apa?

1146
01:17:05,501 --> 01:17:06,583
Sudah? Itu saja?

1147
01:17:06,584 --> 01:17:07,583
Sebentar.

1148
01:17:07,584 --> 01:17:09,251
Sudah terlambat untuk menyesal.

1149
01:17:10,168 --> 01:17:11,334
Siapa pun dia.

1150
01:17:11,918 --> 01:17:13,458
Dia menipu kita, 'kan?

1151
01:17:13,459 --> 01:17:15,208
Ya, dia menipu kita.

1152
01:17:15,209 --> 01:17:16,417
Itu cukup jelas.

1153
01:17:16,418 --> 01:17:18,459
Jadi, bayangkan…

1154
01:17:20,209 --> 01:17:21,458
kita adalah dia.

1155
01:17:21,459 --> 01:17:23,084
Perampokan besar kita sukses.

1156
01:17:23,626 --> 01:17:24,793
Selanjutnya apa?

1157
01:18:01,001 --> 01:18:01,917
C-4.

1158
01:18:01,918 --> 01:18:03,208
Kuno.

1159
01:18:03,209 --> 01:18:04,959
Satu-satunya yang bisa diandalkan.

1160
01:18:06,376 --> 01:18:08,251
Dan… bum.

1161
01:18:23,376 --> 01:18:26,083
- Hai, Sayang.
- Aku harus bicara dengan Ibu.

1162
01:18:26,084 --> 01:18:28,583
Bagaimana kabar Ayahmu? Kalian akur?

1163
01:18:28,584 --> 01:18:30,084
Dia membayar Ibu, bukan?

1164
01:18:31,501 --> 01:18:33,583
- Membayar Ibu?
- Ya, membayar Ibu.

1165
01:18:33,584 --> 01:18:35,293
Itu yang kukatakan. Dia bayar Ibu?

1166
01:18:36,459 --> 01:18:38,375
Tentu saja tidak. Sama sekali.

1167
01:18:38,376 --> 01:18:41,292
- Jujurlah.
- Hei, Jérémie. Tolong.

1168
01:18:41,293 --> 01:18:42,293
Layanan kamar.

1169
01:18:44,043 --> 01:18:45,793
Ibu di mana? Ibu bercanda?

1170
01:18:47,084 --> 01:18:49,000
Ibu di mana? Katakan padaku.

1171
01:18:49,001 --> 01:18:51,458
- Akan Ibu jelaskan.
- Silakan. Ibu di Tahiti?

1172
01:18:51,459 --> 01:18:53,458
Ayolah, tentu saja tidak.

1173
01:18:53,459 --> 01:18:56,750
- Kalau begitu, Ibu di mana?
- Ibu tidak bisa dengar.

1174
01:18:56,751 --> 01:18:57,875
Jangan, Ibu.

1175
01:18:57,876 --> 01:18:59,667
Suaramu putus-putus. Halo?

1176
01:18:59,668 --> 01:19:01,293
Halo? Ibu?

1177
01:19:01,834 --> 01:19:03,668
Sial!

1178
01:19:08,334 --> 01:19:10,167
Mona Lisa: masih menghilang

1179
01:19:10,168 --> 01:19:11,918
Kenapa kita tak menduga hal ini?

1180
01:19:12,459 --> 01:19:14,918
Semua bagian dari rencana.

1181
01:19:15,709 --> 01:19:18,251
Lab DNA, rumahnya,

1182
01:19:19,543 --> 01:19:20,459
Jaguar.

1183
01:19:21,209 --> 01:19:22,501
Dia memanipulasi kita.

1184
01:19:23,251 --> 01:19:26,417
Saat merasa kita meragukannya,
dia lakukan trik pengacara.

1185
01:19:26,418 --> 01:19:30,583
Membereskan urusanku,
tapi situasinya mendadak gawat.

1186
01:19:30,584 --> 01:19:35,500
Jadi, Nona Chiara Ferraro
dan Tuan Jérémie Mercie.

1187
01:19:35,501 --> 01:19:37,875
Berkas harus selesai besok.

1188
01:19:37,876 --> 01:19:39,626
Waktunya sangat singkat.

1189
01:19:40,209 --> 01:19:41,043
Aku tahu.

1190
01:19:44,668 --> 01:19:46,168
Jadi, kau bukan adikku.

1191
01:19:54,209 --> 01:19:56,709
Aku tak pernah jadi adik
atau anak seseorang.

1192
01:19:59,876 --> 01:20:01,459
Tak pernah kubayangkan…

1193
01:20:03,251 --> 01:20:05,876
apa rasanya memiliki adik dan…

1194
01:20:09,584 --> 01:20:10,668
aku akan sangat…

1195
01:20:11,834 --> 01:20:12,918
merindukanmu.

1196
01:20:15,876 --> 01:20:18,542
Aku akan selalu jadi adikmu.

1197
01:20:18,543 --> 01:20:20,251
Kalau kau mau jadi kakakku.

1198
01:20:22,376 --> 01:20:23,209
Baik.

1199
01:20:23,918 --> 01:20:24,793
Sekarang…

1200
01:20:26,334 --> 01:20:27,417
Kita tangkap dia.

1201
01:20:27,418 --> 01:20:30,001
Sekarang, dia ada di Meksiko atau Jakarta.

1202
01:20:30,709 --> 01:20:31,959
Belum. Pertama-tama…

1203
01:20:32,876 --> 01:20:34,333
dia harus mengantarnya.

1204
01:20:34,334 --> 01:20:36,125
Dia baru menyeberang ke Italia.

1205
01:20:36,126 --> 01:20:37,417
Apa itu?

1206
01:20:37,418 --> 01:20:38,625
Dia punya pacu jantung.

1207
01:20:38,626 --> 01:20:42,042
Pakai Bluetooth, agar dokternya
bisa memantau dari jauh.

1208
01:20:42,043 --> 01:20:43,250
Bagaimana kau tahu?

1209
01:20:43,251 --> 01:20:45,501
Karena aku sangat mahir dalam pekerjaanku.

1210
01:20:49,334 --> 01:20:52,375
Baru sehari setelah Louvre mengonfirmasi

1211
01:20:52,376 --> 01:20:54,750
bahwa Mona Lisa karya Leonardo da Vinci,

1212
01:20:54,751 --> 01:20:57,458
salah satu lukisan
paling terkenal di dunia,

1213
01:20:57,459 --> 01:21:01,167
telah dicuri dari museum
pada tengah malam.

1214
01:21:01,168 --> 01:21:02,917
Detailnya masih belum jelas,

1215
01:21:02,918 --> 01:21:04,001
tapi pencurian itu…

1216
01:21:09,709 --> 01:21:11,168
MENUNGGUMU

1217
01:21:17,084 --> 01:21:18,084
BESOK

1218
01:21:34,584 --> 01:21:36,709
Dan kau bisa pergi juga.

1219
01:21:50,709 --> 01:21:52,417
Dia belum bergerak berjam-jam.

1220
01:21:52,418 --> 01:21:54,543
Mungkin hanya sinyal umpan.

1221
01:21:55,626 --> 01:21:56,751
Atau masih tidur.

1222
01:22:01,084 --> 01:22:02,084
Kenapa menunggu?

1223
01:22:03,126 --> 01:22:04,668
Menurutku, rampok dia sekarang.

1224
01:22:05,126 --> 01:22:06,293
Masuk, keluar, 60 detik.

1225
01:22:07,376 --> 01:22:08,542
Lalu apa?

1226
01:22:08,543 --> 01:22:09,750
Kita tak bisa jual.

1227
01:22:09,751 --> 01:22:11,251
Dia tak bohong soal itu.

1228
01:22:12,501 --> 01:22:13,959
Lihat, dia bergerak.

1229
01:22:15,876 --> 01:22:17,750
Baik, jadi sekarang dia menjualnya,

1230
01:22:17,751 --> 01:22:19,375
mendapat uangnya.

1231
01:22:19,376 --> 01:22:21,833
Tunai, bitkoin, akta properti, apa pun.

1232
01:22:21,834 --> 01:22:24,792
Kita cegat dia di tepi jalan.
Gaya kuno.

1233
01:22:24,793 --> 01:22:26,292
Waktunya 60 detik.

1234
01:22:26,293 --> 01:22:27,709
- Aku suka. Ya.
- Ya.

1235
01:22:44,626 --> 01:22:47,751
Bajingan tua.

1236
01:23:12,668 --> 01:23:14,709
Belok kiri, satu kilometer lagi.

1237
01:23:15,959 --> 01:23:16,876
Baik.

1238
01:24:04,668 --> 01:24:05,834
Jangan.

1239
01:25:01,751 --> 01:25:02,626
Pesawat nirawak.

1240
01:25:08,418 --> 01:25:09,418
Baik.

1241
01:25:12,584 --> 01:25:13,709
Baiklah.

1242
01:25:23,501 --> 01:25:24,667
Hati-hati.

1243
01:25:24,668 --> 01:25:28,209
Tuan Cavendish.

1244
01:25:28,709 --> 01:25:31,792
Senang kau bisa tepat waktu.

1245
01:25:31,793 --> 01:25:33,543
Kau tahu aku.

1246
01:25:34,126 --> 01:25:35,334
Demi kepuasanmu.

1247
01:25:40,001 --> 01:25:43,042
Kau tak datang dengan tangan kosong?

1248
01:25:43,043 --> 01:25:44,584
Tidak.

1249
01:25:45,293 --> 01:25:46,542
Mari.

1250
01:25:46,543 --> 01:25:49,584
Timku menyiapkan semua
yang kita butuhkan di sana.

1251
01:25:51,126 --> 01:25:52,126
Ayo.

1252
01:25:55,959 --> 01:25:58,668
Kami siap untukmu, Profesor.

1253
01:26:08,668 --> 01:26:09,668
Ini dia.

1254
01:26:10,293 --> 01:26:12,500
Kulihat kau sudah menyiapkan semuanya.

1255
01:26:12,501 --> 01:26:14,584
Aku membawa ini, tapi…

1256
01:26:15,376 --> 01:26:17,792
kurasa peralatanmu lebih baik.

1257
01:26:17,793 --> 01:26:20,876
Aku kaget kau kaget.

1258
01:26:23,293 --> 01:26:25,459
- Belakang pohon.
- Ya, aku tahu. Bisa lihat.

1259
01:26:28,834 --> 01:26:29,750
Baiklah.

1260
01:26:29,751 --> 01:26:31,543
- Baik.
- Aku siap.

1261
01:26:41,459 --> 01:26:43,043
Ini dia.

1262
01:26:45,876 --> 01:26:48,709
Ada di hadapanku.

1263
01:26:53,126 --> 01:26:55,708
Dr. Ludovico bilang tak boleh lagi…

1264
01:26:55,709 --> 01:26:57,626
Diamlah.

1265
01:27:13,834 --> 01:27:14,709
Jadi,

1266
01:27:18,584 --> 01:27:22,292
Da Vinci melukis sketsa kasar

1267
01:27:22,293 --> 01:27:24,458
di bawah lukisannya?

1268
01:27:24,459 --> 01:27:26,583
Ya. Perbaikan dari tangan

1269
01:27:26,584 --> 01:27:28,125
dan awal dari lukisan lain.

1270
01:27:28,126 --> 01:27:32,001
Kuharap kau tak berencana
untuk memberikan…

1271
01:27:33,293 --> 01:27:35,834
barang palsu seperti terakhir kali.

1272
01:27:37,459 --> 01:27:41,250
Keaslian alternatif,
jika kau tak keberatan.

1273
01:27:41,251 --> 01:27:42,625
Tidak.

1274
01:27:42,626 --> 01:27:43,793
Tentu tidak.

1275
01:27:47,918 --> 01:27:49,126
Baik.

1276
01:27:51,501 --> 01:27:54,126
Aku tak hanya membayar lukisannya.

1277
01:27:54,626 --> 01:27:56,668
Ceritanya adalah bagian dari kesepakatan.

1278
01:27:57,959 --> 01:28:02,668
Tunggu. Apa rahasia keluarga
yang kau ceritakan?

1279
01:28:03,251 --> 01:28:05,000
Rahasia itu seperti jamur.

1280
01:28:05,001 --> 01:28:06,001
Jamur?

1281
01:28:07,459 --> 01:28:09,251
Lebih baik tidak tahu apa-apa.

1282
01:28:10,543 --> 01:28:12,042
Entah mereka bicara apa.

1283
01:28:12,043 --> 01:28:13,500
Bagaimana kau melakukannya?

1284
01:28:13,501 --> 01:28:15,375
Saudari angkatku tuli.

1285
01:28:15,376 --> 01:28:16,833
Dia mengajariku.

1286
01:28:16,834 --> 01:28:20,000
Aku harus mencari profesional yang patuh

1287
01:28:20,001 --> 01:28:21,584
dan takkan usil.

1288
01:28:22,084 --> 01:28:25,667
Mengingat ada begitu banyak keluarga
yang terpecah…

1289
01:28:25,668 --> 01:28:27,167
di dunia kriminal,

1290
01:28:27,168 --> 01:28:29,792
kupikir, "Peran apa yang lebih baik

1291
01:28:29,793 --> 01:28:33,334
daripada ayah yang telah lama hilang?"

1292
01:28:35,001 --> 01:28:38,375
Yang sulit adalah mencari orang bodoh
yang sempurna.

1293
01:28:38,376 --> 01:28:39,626
Orang bodoh.

1294
01:28:41,834 --> 01:28:43,251
Dungu?

1295
01:28:46,376 --> 01:28:47,917
Dua bocah

1296
01:28:47,918 --> 01:28:50,084
yang bodoh dan mudah diperdaya.

1297
01:28:50,793 --> 01:28:52,375
Astaga.

1298
01:28:52,376 --> 01:28:55,418
Kau bajingan tua.

1299
01:28:56,084 --> 01:28:57,459
Bagus sekali.

1300
01:28:58,293 --> 01:28:59,459
Profesor…

1301
01:29:01,126 --> 01:29:03,625
- Senang?
- Ya.

1302
01:29:03,626 --> 01:29:06,042
- Pencitraan lapisan bawah terlihat benar.
- Baik.

1303
01:29:06,043 --> 01:29:08,042
- Dan pecahan catnya cocok.
- Bagus.

1304
01:29:08,043 --> 01:29:10,833
Tentu, butuh satu hari
agar bisa konfirmasi.

1305
01:29:10,834 --> 01:29:15,001
Sepertinya kita punya pemenang
di sini, Tuan Cavendish.

1306
01:29:15,584 --> 01:29:18,334
Selamat atas akuisisi barumu.

1307
01:29:18,959 --> 01:29:21,875
Yang membawaku pada perjanjian kita.

1308
01:29:21,876 --> 01:29:22,917
Ya, tentu.

1309
01:29:22,918 --> 01:29:25,709
Kau sudah melunasi utangmu padaku.

1310
01:29:27,334 --> 01:29:28,501
Setelah mengatakannya…

1311
01:29:31,793 --> 01:29:35,126
bagaimana bisa aku membiarkan hidup

1312
01:29:36,043 --> 01:29:38,334
orang yang mengetahui apa yang kupunya?

1313
01:29:39,876 --> 01:29:43,793
Aku yakin kau mengerti, Cavendish.

1314
01:29:44,751 --> 01:29:46,958
Terima kasih, Bruno. Sungguh.

1315
01:29:46,959 --> 01:29:48,001
Terima kasih?

1316
01:29:49,043 --> 01:29:50,043
Untuk apa?

1317
01:29:51,376 --> 01:29:53,459
Karena lakukan apa yang kuinginkan.

1318
01:29:55,001 --> 01:29:55,834
Jangan bergerak.

1319
01:30:00,793 --> 01:30:01,626
Apa?

1320
01:30:08,043 --> 01:30:09,334
Merunduk!

1321
01:30:15,084 --> 01:30:16,708
Perlihatkan tanganmu!

1322
01:30:16,709 --> 01:30:17,543
Persetan.

1323
01:30:22,334 --> 01:30:23,459
Hadirin yang terhormat,

1324
01:30:24,001 --> 01:30:25,293
Republik Prancis.

1325
01:30:29,084 --> 01:30:31,542
Dalam misi repatriasi.

1326
01:30:31,543 --> 01:30:32,751
Élysée?

1327
01:30:33,543 --> 01:30:35,168
Lise kembali pulang.

1328
01:30:47,709 --> 01:30:49,875
Angkatan bersenjata Italia,
jangan bergerak.

1329
01:30:49,876 --> 01:30:50,876
Sial.

1330
01:30:54,168 --> 01:30:57,084
Palazzo Chigi? La Gioconda kembali pulang.

1331
01:30:58,543 --> 01:31:00,583
Orang Italia datang. Operasi terganggu.

1332
01:31:00,584 --> 01:31:02,626
Meminta tabir asap sebelum evakuasi.

1333
01:31:24,126 --> 01:31:25,293
Ayo.

1334
01:31:26,543 --> 01:31:27,709
Terima kasih.

1335
01:31:44,501 --> 01:31:45,708
Ayo pergi!

1336
01:31:45,709 --> 01:31:47,376
Evakuasi!

1337
01:31:47,959 --> 01:31:49,668
Ayo, jangan tinggal di sini!

1338
01:31:53,751 --> 01:31:54,833
Belum?

1339
01:31:54,834 --> 01:31:56,501
Ayolah.

1340
01:31:58,918 --> 01:31:59,918
Tentara.

1341
01:32:01,459 --> 01:32:02,293
Berhenti!

1342
01:32:04,209 --> 01:32:05,293
Persetan.

1343
01:32:08,501 --> 01:32:09,334
Persetan!

1344
01:32:27,293 --> 01:32:29,459
Ada mobil menuju perbatasan Prancis.

1345
01:32:29,959 --> 01:32:31,876
Mengerti. Kami ke sana.

1346
01:33:06,418 --> 01:33:08,376
Ayo, tenangkan dirimu.

1347
01:33:09,084 --> 01:33:10,001
Persetan!

1348
01:33:13,543 --> 01:33:14,459
Persetan!

1349
01:33:27,959 --> 01:33:29,250
Masuk. Sekarang!

1350
01:33:29,251 --> 01:33:30,126
Ayo!

1351
01:33:44,543 --> 01:33:47,125
Senang bertemu denganmu,
sosiopat berengsek.

1352
01:33:47,126 --> 01:33:48,417
Tentu. Apa kabar?

1353
01:33:48,418 --> 01:33:49,417
Pengkhianat.

1354
01:33:49,418 --> 01:33:52,584
Aku menyelamatkan kalian, omong-omong.

1355
01:33:56,418 --> 01:33:58,375
Baiklah, jadi mana uang kami?

1356
01:33:58,376 --> 01:34:00,125
Uang? Tak ada uang.

1357
01:34:00,126 --> 01:34:01,168
- Apa?
- Apa?

1358
01:34:02,001 --> 01:34:04,000
Kau beri lukisan itu
ke pria kursi roda.

1359
01:34:04,001 --> 01:34:05,750
- Benar.
- Gratis?

1360
01:34:05,751 --> 01:34:09,167
Kau pikir kita bisa lolos
dengan mencuri dan menjual

1361
01:34:09,168 --> 01:34:11,250
lukisan paling bernilai di dunia?

1362
01:34:11,251 --> 01:34:14,542
Itu seperti mencoba menjual bom nuklir
di pasar petani.

1363
01:34:14,543 --> 01:34:16,334
Kenapa kau berikan padanya?

1364
01:34:17,293 --> 01:34:18,417
- Siap-siap!
- Awas!

1365
01:34:18,418 --> 01:34:19,251
Astaga!

1366
01:34:21,334 --> 01:34:22,833
ITALIA
PRANCIS

1367
01:34:22,834 --> 01:34:24,750
- Sialan! Mereka pergi!
- Persetan!

1368
01:34:24,751 --> 01:34:26,250
Lukisannya adalah alat.

1369
01:34:26,251 --> 01:34:28,458
- Aku berutang pada Van Klum.
- Van siapa?

1370
01:34:28,459 --> 01:34:29,917
Pria berkursi roda.

1371
01:34:29,918 --> 01:34:31,417
- Utang apa?
- Besar.

1372
01:34:31,418 --> 01:34:33,125
Apa yang kau lakukan padanya?

1373
01:34:33,126 --> 01:34:34,167
Jangan bahas itu.

1374
01:34:34,168 --> 01:34:35,334
Apa yang salah?

1375
01:34:35,959 --> 01:34:38,000
Pria seperti dia selalu muncul.

1376
01:34:38,001 --> 01:34:41,292
Satu-satunya caraku bebas
adalah jika dia dipenjara atau mati.

1377
01:34:41,293 --> 01:34:43,708
Jadi kau menelepon Prancis dan Italia.

1378
01:34:43,709 --> 01:34:45,875
Mereka melihatnya memegang Mona Lisa,

1379
01:34:45,876 --> 01:34:48,500
satu-satunya yang tak bisa
dilindungi uangnya.

1380
01:34:48,501 --> 01:34:51,667
Kau tahu Prancis memakai asap
untuk kabur. Itu dia.

1381
01:34:51,668 --> 01:34:53,375
- Kau ternyata pintar.
- Persetan!

1382
01:34:53,376 --> 01:34:54,708
Kau bukan Snow Leopard.

1383
01:34:54,709 --> 01:34:56,917
Tidak. Aku tahu itu. Aku pembohong.

1384
01:34:56,918 --> 01:34:58,583
Aku orang mengerikan

1385
01:34:58,584 --> 01:35:00,458
yang pantas dibenci.

1386
01:35:00,459 --> 01:35:03,250
Tapi kalian satu-satunya keluarga
yang kupunya.

1387
01:35:03,251 --> 01:35:04,583
Astaga, mau muntah.

1388
01:35:04,584 --> 01:35:06,292
Begitulah saat kau melihat cermin.

1389
01:35:06,293 --> 01:35:07,708
Dia berbohong lagi.

1390
01:35:07,709 --> 01:35:09,875
Tidak. Aku tak berbohong di sana.

1391
01:35:09,876 --> 01:35:12,168
Ya, sedikit. Hanya untuk…

1392
01:35:12,918 --> 01:35:13,918
Berpegangan.

1393
01:35:22,793 --> 01:35:25,583
Baiklah, keluar.
Kalian berdua, sekarang. Keluar.

1394
01:35:25,584 --> 01:35:26,584
Cepat.

1395
01:35:27,209 --> 01:35:28,209
Sial.

1396
01:35:33,001 --> 01:35:34,542
Persetan!

1397
01:35:34,543 --> 01:35:35,584
Baik.

1398
01:35:38,126 --> 01:35:40,292
Italia di sana,

1399
01:35:40,293 --> 01:35:41,958
Prancis di sisi lain, tentu.

1400
01:35:41,959 --> 01:35:44,875
Secara teknis, ini bukan tanah siapa pun.

1401
01:35:44,876 --> 01:35:46,958
Mereka tak bisa masuk ke sini.

1402
01:35:46,959 --> 01:35:51,459
Pintu itu adalah rute evakuasi tua
untuk pekerja yang membuat tempat ini.

1403
01:35:52,084 --> 01:35:56,083
Niatku meninggalkan mobil
dan hilang lewat sana,

1404
01:35:56,084 --> 01:35:57,876
lalu kalian berdua muncul dan…

1405
01:36:09,334 --> 01:36:10,168
Ini.

1406
01:36:11,209 --> 01:36:12,126
Ambillah.

1407
01:36:13,543 --> 01:36:16,250
Berkarat, tapi sudah kuminyaki.

1408
01:36:16,251 --> 01:36:17,459
Pergi.

1409
01:36:19,043 --> 01:36:20,167
Kenapa kau begini?

1410
01:36:20,168 --> 01:36:21,250
Kenapa tak ikut kami?

1411
01:36:21,251 --> 01:36:23,042
Kenapa… kenapa kulakukan ini?

1412
01:36:23,043 --> 01:36:25,667
Karena mereka belum mengetahui kalian.

1413
01:36:25,668 --> 01:36:27,000
Belum ada yang memburumu.

1414
01:36:27,001 --> 01:36:28,917
Tak kukira akan mengatakan ini,

1415
01:36:28,918 --> 01:36:31,708
tapi jika ada hal buruk
yang menimpa seseorang,

1416
01:36:31,709 --> 01:36:33,333
lebih baik terjadi padaku

1417
01:36:33,334 --> 01:36:34,584
daripada kalian.

1418
01:36:39,751 --> 01:36:41,834
Kami menyayangimu juga, Pria Gila.

1419
01:36:44,918 --> 01:36:47,334
Itu yang dilakukan ayah, bukan?

1420
01:36:49,251 --> 01:36:51,126
Kau bukan ayah kami, Roger.

1421
01:36:52,668 --> 01:36:53,833
Benar, maaf.

1422
01:36:53,834 --> 01:36:55,001
Siapa kau sebenarnya?

1423
01:36:57,084 --> 01:36:58,209
Sesungguhnya?

1424
01:37:03,918 --> 01:37:04,834
Siapa aku?

1425
01:37:13,376 --> 01:37:15,668
Namaku Marcus Dubrovik,

1426
01:37:18,126 --> 01:37:19,584
dari New Jersey.

1427
01:37:20,168 --> 01:37:23,626
Tepatnya Summit City, kurasa.

1428
01:37:25,376 --> 01:37:26,293
Meski begitu…

1429
01:37:29,668 --> 01:37:30,959
Sudahlah.

1430
01:37:33,709 --> 01:37:34,709
Ya.

1431
01:37:35,793 --> 01:37:36,668
Maaf.

1432
01:37:41,334 --> 01:37:42,709
Jaga diri kalian.

1433
01:38:04,209 --> 01:38:05,209
Aku pergi ke sana.

1434
01:38:06,209 --> 01:38:08,543
Makanan penjara Italia
lebih baik dari Prancis.

1435
01:38:53,001 --> 01:38:55,209
Keluar dari mobil!

1436
01:38:55,626 --> 01:38:57,875
Angkat tangan!

1437
01:38:57,876 --> 01:38:59,542
Baik.

1438
01:38:59,543 --> 01:39:01,542
- Perlahan!
- Tangan di belakang kepala!

1439
01:39:01,543 --> 01:39:02,458
Baik.

1440
01:39:02,459 --> 01:39:03,667
Tolong!

1441
01:39:03,668 --> 01:39:04,667
Merunduk!

1442
01:39:04,668 --> 01:39:05,750
Jangan tembak!

1443
01:39:05,751 --> 01:39:07,209
Tangan di belakang kepala!

1444
01:39:08,709 --> 01:39:09,626
Jangan menembak.

1445
01:39:10,668 --> 01:39:12,001
Aku punya keluarga.

1446
01:39:20,418 --> 01:39:22,918
SATU TAHUN KEMUDIAN

1447
01:39:50,626 --> 01:39:51,501
Sial.

1448
01:40:01,709 --> 01:40:02,793
Sial!

1449
01:40:07,376 --> 01:40:08,583
Ayo!

1450
01:40:08,584 --> 01:40:09,542
Masuk!

1451
01:40:09,543 --> 01:40:10,543
Ayo, masuk!

1452
01:40:23,418 --> 01:40:24,333
Kenapa lama?

1453
01:40:24,334 --> 01:40:25,292
Kami tepat waktu.

1454
01:40:25,293 --> 01:40:26,458
Bung, kau bau.

1455
01:40:26,459 --> 01:40:27,375
Maafkan aku.

1456
01:40:27,376 --> 01:40:30,417
Aku mau naik helikopter,
tapi lebih suka selokan.

1457
01:40:30,418 --> 01:40:31,333
Di Mogadishu.

1458
01:40:31,334 --> 01:40:32,625
Berhenti bahas Mogadishu.

1459
01:40:32,626 --> 01:40:34,208
Baik. Maksudku Kathmandu.

1460
01:40:34,209 --> 01:40:35,625
- Kathmandu?
- Terserah!

1461
01:40:35,626 --> 01:40:37,167
Mona Lisa. Masih hilang.

1462
01:40:37,168 --> 01:40:38,125
Tentu saja.

1463
01:40:38,126 --> 01:40:40,125
Itu butuh waktu yang lama.

1464
01:40:40,126 --> 01:40:42,500
Melapisi perbaikan dan semuanya.

1465
01:40:42,501 --> 01:40:44,667
Maksudmu yang diberikan
pada Van Klum palsu?

1466
01:40:44,668 --> 01:40:46,375
Tentu. Kau pikir aku bodoh?

1467
01:40:46,376 --> 01:40:48,333
- Barang palsu lainnya?
- Ya.

1468
01:40:48,334 --> 01:40:51,750
Harus kubilang, mungkin terbaik
yang pernah dibuat. Sungguh.

1469
01:40:51,751 --> 01:40:53,333
Jadi, ada di mana?

1470
01:40:53,334 --> 01:40:54,459
Ya, ada di mana?

1471
01:47:00,584 --> 01:47:02,667
Terjemahan subtitle oleh D I Padmadiwiria

